    "updated_at": "2019-11-25T14:08:24Z",
    "body": "To be clear, we need many more tests for this. E.g., https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/20432 cannot use `assert_class_string` because browsers are quite different in what kind of `Document` object they use for `.svg` web-platform-tests resources. Firefox uses `XMLDocument`, Safari uses `HTMLDocument`.\r\n\r\nAnd also, the specification side for all those things needs to be crystal clear. A lot of this is \"Page load processing model ...\" but there's also various other algorithms that end up creating `Document` objects.",
