    "created_at": "2019-12-02T10:32:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-02T10:32:26Z",
    "body": "I think the ambition was always to have these classes merged as having them separate does not make a whole lot of sense. So now that they're somewhat separate we'll have to say which document creator creates which class.",
